flowchart TD
    B[Browser]
    N[Nginx :80\nRate limiting + security headers]
    F[Frontend Next.js :3000]
    G[API Gateway :8000\nJWT auth + routing + CORS]
    BS[Business Service :8001\nREST + gRPC server]
    RS[Recommendation Service :8002\nREST + gRPC client]
    IS[Ingestion Service :8003\nDataset loader + invalidation]
    PG[(PostgreSQL :5432\n~10.2M records)]
    R[(Redis 7 :6379\nCache-aside + LRU 256MB + AOF/RDB)]

    B -->|HTTP| N
    N -->|/| F
    N -->|/api/*| G
    G --> BS
    G --> RS
    BS <--> |gRPC :50051| RS
    BS --> PG
    RS --> PG
    IS --> PG
    BS --> R
    RS --> R
    IS -. cache invalidation .-> R
